                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's surprisingly fun and deserves to be remembered even after all these years!\n\nPROS:\n+ INCREDIBLE mobility and feeling of momentum thanks to the hook and rocket jumps\n+ Picking up massive objects and throwing them feels satisfying when taking out enemies\n+ Graphics good enough to not make you realize this was 2011\n+ Unique weaponry, each with two firing modes\n+ Does an impressive job with story considering the lack of dialogue\n+ Genuinely difficult if you want it to be\n\nCONS:\n- Controls can take a moment to get used to what every button does\n- By default only goes up to 1920x1080\n- Not enough good music\n- I swear every secret is just you going through a wall that looks like it is there, but is not\n\nReally fun game! I almost wish it could get a remaster or an update after all these years lol",
                        "timestamp_created": 1788319859,
